_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@havilaladlf/works/112", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 563294, "client_id": 549620, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bb2cf1b9/uploads/origins/b73bb52c-04a9-48ca-898e-47aa8bafc119?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=af3fdb6dce3e78ae33457d9a86477c8b", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bb2cf1b9/uploads/origins/b73bb52c-04a9-48ca-898e-47aa8bafc119?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1d45292d632485b0f2c85d573bd6b555", "src_set": ""}, "body": "フルボッコヒーローズより、信仰者達からの貢ぎ物でもっちりしてきたバステトをお願いします！可能であれば膨腹の差分も是非お願いしたいです...！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1Z0r2cpGvLCcREclVuFs_RCXDJgESEZLb/view?usp=drivesdk", "nc": 32, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@havilaladlf/works/111", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 563294, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4aa3d7b0/uploads/origins/df4be723-cd5b-49a5-afd1-dcc19a14e10d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b2105d986a99d5a51f82b7c74571b917", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": true, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4aa3d7b0/uploads/origins/df4be723-cd5b-49a5-afd1-dcc19a14e10d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1662bd1d639110782a659925d9dc44df", "src_set": ""}, "body": "原神のパイモンちゃんでお願いします。\n\n パイモンちゃんは自身の体積を超える量を飲食出来るので満足するまで飲食した後に全部一気に排泄したら超凄そうなのでお願いします。\n\n ・絵の前の前日章イメージです。\n変態な男の頼みで害獣や野草などを満足するまでどんどん飲食してきたパイモンちゃんが裸になって変態な男に裸と凄い排泄を見せつけてくるイメージです。 \n\nO絵の画面は変態な男の視界なイメージです。\n仰向けに寝転がって全裸大開脚しているパイモンちゃんが可愛い乳首・プニマン・肛門を見せつけながら物凄い放尿と超極太カチカチ超特大一本グソの排便をじっくり見せつけてあげているパイモンちゃんでお願いします。\n\nプニマンは 大開脚に引っ張られて開いているイメージです。\n\n・この時、変態な男の片手の人差し指で超ぶっとい排便に合わせて伸びている綺麗な肛門をタッチしているのかはお任せします。 \n\nよろしくお願いします。", "nc": 187, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@havilaladlf/works/110", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cb2ea3b9/uploads/origins/d267fb6e-99fd-482e-b265-504337daba2f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=8549da9be4e4a1e381bac081888ef4eb", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 563294, "client_id": 108032, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 161, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@havilaladlf/works/109", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 563294, "client_id": 332022, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b7fefdd8/uploads/origins/ce9216f1-33cd-4eca-ab48-4fe05d026dc2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9de8d34a16702da02e32fa89459fd8a2", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b7fefdd8/uploads/origins/ce9216f1-33cd-4eca-ab48-4fe05d026dc2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a59210c52c04a60256553ab412f2642d", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Ok this is a comic cover style of a project with glori. The premise is her meeting a friend at the zoo where she will untin a bukkake  from various animals like zebras and tapir. Let just start with the first page cover.\n \nCharacter reference \nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/fold